<title>BELGIUM: RESEARCH ALERT-Take profits in PetroFina.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Take profits in PetroFina.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maintain an underweight stance on oil values and take profits in PetroFina, Salomon Brothers said in its July 10 oil and gas research update.</p>
<p>Jeremy Hudson and Gordon Gray (+44 171 721 3358) rated PetroFina 'underperform', adding its short-term view was negative. Their price target was 12,500 Belgian francs, which compared a price of 13,750 at the time the report was written.</p>
<p>They said PetroFina had seen a six percent decline in its relative price from its recent peak, but it was still fully valued relative to the sector.</p>
<p>    Estimates:   1997   1998   1999   (1996)</p>
<p> EPS *	     708    768    946    (692)</p>
<p> P/E *		19.4   17.9   14.5   (19.9)</p>
